      "html": "<p>A beautiful and absolutely peaceful loach from China. The species is an ideal bottom dweller for unheated community tanks. Females grow to around 10 cm, while males stay much smaller.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/cobitis_macrostigma_en/",
      "html": "<p>The optimal temperatures for the fish are between 10 and 24°C.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/cobitis_macrostigma_en/",
      "html": "<p>The fish feeds readily on any type of usual fishfood.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/cobitis_macrostigma_en/",
      "html": "<p>Females become around 10 cm long, while males stay much smaller.</p>"
    },
